CAPI=2:
name: "open:soc:sv_peripherals_interconnect_suite:1.0.0"
description: "Complete 16-IP SystemVerilog Peripheral Library (incl. Chrom-ART 2D GPU) with Wishbone B4, AXI4, and TileLink Crossbars, Register Slices, Smart Switch & Bridges"

